<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore sees 1997 CPI rising 1.5-2.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Singapore sees 1997 CPI rising 1.5-2.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore expects its consumer price index (CPI) to rise between 1.5 and 2.0 percent in 1997, officials told reporters on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The CPI rose 1.4 percent in 1996.</p>
</text>
